      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The salesperson was quick to contact me (reached out on the same day I submitted my inquiry through Solar Quotes). Over the course of the next two weeks, they were in contact often. It was slightly overbearing at times but they were able to meet my budget constraints and I was happy with the quote, so we signed and went head.Installation was scheduled for a week and a half later. There were a team of four there bright and early. It took two days from start to finish. The end result was very processional. Cables managed well around the inverter and switchboard, and panels positioned to take advantage of the sun direction.Everyone I spoke to was professional and clearly both knew what they were doing, and were passionate about it. If I was really being picky, the only thing that perhaps could have been a little better was communication in the time before and after the installation. There were a few days after signing where I didn't know what was happening, and after the installation working out what needed to be done for feed-in to be activated, but I fully understand this is due to it being a very busy period.I wouldn't hesitate to recommend GreenSaver Solar to friends and family in the future!",
