      "review_description": "Very happy with the whole process with Green Saver Solar. Simon came out to view our house and returned a quote for us in great time. He was happy to work with us on what we wanted and give advice as to what we needed etc.The installation started very quickly (I think a few days after signing up), and took just a couple of days to complete (it is a large 15kw system). The whole team were really professional, tidy, and didn't mind my kids watching them the whole time :)All of the required permissions from Powercor and connections were organised by Simon, so the whole process went really smoothly. Couldn't be happier and the system has been running really well. Highly recommend.",
